<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT SWEDEN 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT SWEDEN 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland beat Sweden 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in their World Cup European group four qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: John McGinlay 8.</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>Group four standings</p>
<p> Scotland	     3   2   1   0   3   0   7</p>
<p> Austria		3   2   1   0   3   1   7</p>
<p> Sweden		 4   2   0   2   7   4   6</p>
<p> Belarus		4   1   1   2   3   7   4</p>
<p> Estonia		2   1   0   1   1   1   3</p>
<p> Latvia		 4   0   1   3   3   7   1</p>
<p>Next match: March 29 Scotland v Estonia</p>
</text>
